# RGSP H700 input template
#
# Do not install this file yet. The current kernel reports the D-pad as
# ABS_HAT0X/ABS_HAT0Y and game buttons as BTN_*; Android may expose those
# through a joystick device instead of KEY events. Confirm with getevent first.
# Place the final device-specific file under /system/usr/keylayout/ using the
# exact EventHub device name or VID/PID-derived filename.

# Typical Linux KEY_* examples only; uncomment only after verification.
# key 103   DPAD_UP
# key 108   DPAD_DOWN
# key 105   DPAD_LEFT
# key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
# key 28    ENTER
# key _BACK  BACK
# key 102   HOME
# key 139   MENU

# If the device is exposed as a gamepad, prefer Android gamepad mapping or an
# InputReader calibration rather than guessing key numbers here.
